[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11405.349, "timestamp": "03:10:05", "text": "呃，好的。呃，我是个失败者。我是一名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11407.83, "timestamp": "03:10:07", "text": "YouTube上的小主播。嗯，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11410.469, "timestamp": "03:10:10", "text": "我要打败你们所有人。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11412.15, "timestamp": "03:10:12", "text": "你会打败我的。你成就了你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11415.24, "timestamp": "03:10:15", "text": "最好确认一下它是否已放入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11416.389, "timestamp": "03:10:16", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11417.51, "timestamp": "03:10:17", "text": "我们还差一个。我们还差一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11419.99, "timestamp": "03:10:19", "text": "我们还差一个。是的。你最好……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11423.75, "timestamp": "03:10:23", "text": "你肯定站在这里。站在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11426.389, "timestamp": "03:10:26", "text": "站在这里。稍等片刻。给我一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11428.71, "timestamp": "03:10:28", "text": "第二。我喜欢确保我的直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11430.469, "timestamp": "03:10:30", "text": "其实就像跑步一样，因为我就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11431.83, "timestamp": "03:10:31", "text": "完成了一项技术修复工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.59, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11436.389, "timestamp": "03:10:36", "text": "没关系。谢谢。是吗？是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11439.19, "timestamp": "03:10:39", "text": "跑步？我甚至都不知道。好的。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11440.95, "timestamp": "03:10:40", "text": "正有一群观众盯着你看呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11444.389, "timestamp": "03:10:44", "text": "现在。哦，他正恶狠狠地盯着我，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11453.349, "timestamp": "03:10:53", "text": "我感觉自己受到了视觉攻击。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11456.63, "timestamp": "03:10:56", "text": "所有人都来这里评判。他也没有评判。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11458.11, "timestamp": "03:10:58", "text": "你。"}]